              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ni yaba atoshobora kuronka umwagazi w’intama, az’ azane intunguru zibiri cank’ ivyana vy’inuma bibiri; imwe y’ikimazi co kwoswa, iyindi y’ikimazi co gutangirwa ivyaha: nuk’ umuherezi amuhongere, na we azoba ahumanutse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.8"
            ]
          }
